WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:02.235
Dilbert has been fired.

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.636
The newspaper comic has been around

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:04.704
for more than three decades.

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:06.673
It spawned multiple bestselling books.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.341
It appeared in thousands of newspapers

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:08.942
at its height

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:10.543
with its take on the frustrations

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:11.611
of cubicle work life.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:12.879
But today,

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.314
the syndicate that distributed

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:15.782
Dilbert cut all ties

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:16.783
with its author, Scott

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:19.552
Adams, for blatantly racist remarks.

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.421
Adams, on his YouTube

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:23.623
show, referenced a poll by Rasmussen

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:25.392
that's a pro-Trump media company

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:27.861
whose polls do not meet CNN standards.

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:28.728
The poll

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:29.262
suggested

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:31.664
that 53% of black Americans indicated

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.600
they agree with the statement It's okay

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.401
to be white,

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:35.935
leaving the other 47%

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:38.171
to say they disagree or they aren't sure.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:39.406
We should note here

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:41.074
the significance of that statement.

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:42.075
It's okay to be white.

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:43.043
The Anti-Defamation

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:43.576
League says that

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:44.677
phrase has a long history

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.012
in the white supremacist movement.

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:48.381
So why Rasmussen was polling on it

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.115
is anyone's guess.

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:52.218
But here is what some of what Adam said.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:54.654
So if,

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:57.390
you know, nearly half of all blacks

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.159
are not okay with white people,

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:00.360
according to this poll.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.162
Not according to me.

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:04.230
According to this poll.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.465
That's a hate group.

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.534
The best advice I would give to white

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:09.502
people is to get the hell away

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:11.304
from black people.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.474
A fairly racist statement,

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:15.475
as blatant as it gets.

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:17.410
CNN's Oliver Darcy watching all of this.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:17.610
You know,

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:18.711
Oliver Adams, who

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:19.245
we should note,

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:21.347
came on the lead in the early Trump era

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:22.248
a few times

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:23.650
he's been trending more

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:25.385
and more hard-right for years

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:27.854
now into some really bigoted terrain.

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:28.855
But I guess this

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:30.356
apparently crossed the line

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:32.792
into self-immolation

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:33.927
That's certainly correct, Jake.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:36.062
I mean, if you watch this live stream,

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:36.863
I mean, you just played

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:37.730
some of the comments.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.766
There are frankly very shocking comments.

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:40.800
It seems to be

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.401
that he is

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:42.469
promoting effectively

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:45.672
promoting segregation, saying

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:48.108
that white people should not be helping

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:49.275
black people.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:50.610
They should be staying away from them.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:51.911
And really

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:53.680
really defending these comments

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:56.349
in later broadcasts that I've watched.

00:01:56.349 --> 00:01:56.683
Now, he's

00:01:56.683 --> 00:01:58.618
saying he was being hyperbolic

00:01:58.618 --> 00:01:59.552
and wanting to start

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:02.589
a conversation about race but obviously

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:03.923
making comments like that's

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:05.959
no way to start this conversation.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.560
He's also positioning himself

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.729
as really a free speech martyr here.

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:11.664
But, you know, consequence

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:13.466
he says do follow free speech.

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:14.634
He has the right, of course, to say

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:15.869
whatever he wants.

00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:17.070
These newspapers

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:17.837
and other businesses

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:20.039
have a have a right to sever ties

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:20.740
with them. Yeah.

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.775
He wants to make this cancel culture.

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:23.243
But this is

00:02:23.243 --> 00:02:25.378
this is consequence culture, really.

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:26.045
Now, newspapers

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:27.547
across the country were pulling Dilbert

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.182
even before

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:31.050
the syndicate, the distribution company

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.552
cut ties with Adams today.

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:33.887
This is going to be potentially

00:02:33.887 --> 00:02:36.089
a huge financial blow.

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:38.358
I can imagine that his finances

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:40.426
aren't going to look so great after this,

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:42.395
at least as incomes stream, because,

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:43.096
like you said,

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:44.063
all the newspapers

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:44.898
have really effectively

00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:46.599
canceled the Dilbert comic strip.

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.001
And it's extended beyond that

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:49.169
at this point.

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:49.969
His publisher,

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:51.604
the publisher of a forthcoming book

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.673
that he was set to release in September.

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:55.175
They've now said they're no longer

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:56.576
going to publish that book.

00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:57.977
He had tweeted earlier today

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:00.079
that his book agent had canceled on him.

00:03:00.079 --> 00:03:01.548
So he's going to have some

00:03:01.548 --> 00:03:03.283
professional repercussions

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:03.783
for sure

00:03:03.783 --> 00:03:04.984
as a result of these

00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:07.187
shocking and racist comments.

00:03:07.654 --> 00:03:09.255
Now, whether he's able to leverage

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:11.191
the attention he's receiving

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:13.359
to start something separate,

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:14.561
that remains to be seen.

00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:15.495
But in terms

00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:16.996
of his previous business model,

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:19.299
that's all but been obliterated, Jake.

00:03:19.299 --> 00:03:20.500
Yeah, I mean, he's also in

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:21.568
addition to white

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:24.070
segregation.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:24.637
He's also

00:03:24.637 --> 00:03:27.240
clearly preaching white supremacy.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:30.210
But now Elon Musk is weighing in on Scott

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:32.278
Adams side of this.

00:03:32.278 --> 00:03:33.112
That's

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:33.646
you know,

00:03:33.646 --> 00:03:35.582
if the story couldn't get any crazier,

00:03:35.582 --> 00:03:36.583
it just did.

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:38.051
I guess it's not too crazy

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:40.353
that Elon Musk would say something

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:42.222
you know, that would draw controversy.

00:03:42.222 --> 00:03:44.524
But he was effectively defending

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:45.825
or rushing to Scott's defense

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:47.293
after these shocking comments.

00:03:47.293 --> 00:03:47.927
He said

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:51.497
that the media is racist in one tweet.

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:53.233
And then he went on to elaborate

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:53.700
on that tweet,

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:55.868
not not really doing himself any favors.

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:56.736
Now he's saying that

00:03:56.736 --> 00:03:57.570
he doesn't always agree

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.539
with what Adams does

00:03:59.539 --> 00:04:01.874
but that he finds a Dilbert cartoon

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:02.976
funny. Jake.

00:04:02.976 --> 00:04:03.176
Yeah.

00:04:03.176 --> 00:04:03.910
Nobody's talking about

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:04.911
the Dilbert cartoon.

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:05.778
We're talking about what

00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:07.280
Scott said on the YouTube.

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.648
Oliver Darcy, thanks so much.

